Rāvaṇa charges eagle with blazing twenty eyes --- Rāvaṇa rains sharp arrows met by Jaṭāyu --- Jaṭāyu tears Rāvaṇa limbs with talons --- Jaṭāyu breaks jeweled bow quiver and mule chariot --- Rāvaṇa drops earthward clutching Sītā as beings applaud --- Rāvaṇa rises again clutching Sītā skyward --- Jaṭāyu mounts Rāvaṇa back tearing hair and arms --- Rāvaṇa drops Sītā and cuts off eagle wings